    "preamble": "Hajee K.P.Abdul Kareem & Co vs The Designated Officer on 5 November, 2025",
    "facts": "2.The petitioner is dealing in unmanufactured tobacco. The grievance of the petitioner is that the respondents are interfering with his business. Hence, this writ petition has been filed to forbear the respondents from doing so. The issue involved in these writ petitions was considered in detail in the earlier order passed in W.P.No.29805 of 2024 dated 08.07.2025.",
